# Cecilion, Embrace of Night

> Cecilion is not a mage in the burst sense. He is a mana-stacking countdown wrapped in a robe, a hero whose damage grows every time he casts a skill and whose usefulness is measured in how long the game goes. Draft him into the right shell and he wins fights at minute 20 that no other mage can win; draft him into the wrong one and he never reaches minute 20.

