## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-08. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Lane Standard (Mid)

- Items: Demon Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Divine Glaive
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Genius Wand over Holy Crystal when Enemy has stacked magic defense early (Belerick, Gloo, Barats, Esmeralda). Genius Wand shreds MDEF faster than Holy Crystal multiplies raw damage.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Enemy has two or more untargetable assassins (Ling, Natalia, Fanny). Frozen active buys 2 seconds for your team to collapse.; Glowing Wand over Holy Crystal when Your lane phase is forcing you below 50% HP often or the enemy has heavy sustain (Uranus, Esmeralda, Rafaela support). Scorch burn plus Lifebane anti-heal cut.
- Total cost: 12070 gold

Standard ranked build for squishy matchups. Holy Crystal converts early lead into faster spike timings, Blood Wings closes with a defensive layer Cecilion's kit cannot provide.

### Anti-Tank Shred (Mid)

- Items: Demon Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Divine Glaive, Glowing Wand
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Holy Crystal over Glowing Wand when Enemy tanks are the only HP stackers and have minimal sustain. Raw magic power scales harder vs single high-HP targets.; Wishing Lantern over Glowing Wand when Enemy runs three or more HP-stacking frontliners without healing. Butterfly Goddess 10% current HP nuke triggers constantly from Cecilion's multi-hit kit.; Winter Crown over Glowing Wand when Enemy dives through the frontline to reach you. Sacrifice the HP% burn slot for the survival button.
- Total cost: 11020 gold

When enemy has two or more high-HP frontliners. Genius Wand stacks MDEF shred on every S1 cast, Glowing Wand burns HP% and cuts sustain. Divine Glaive multiplies the shred for true tank-killing output.

### Carmilla Duo Gold Lane (Gold)

- Items: Demon Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal, Genius Wand, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Divine Glaive over Genius Wand when Enemy runs standard frontline without stacked magic defense. Penetration scales better than shred in even matchups.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Enemy coordinates multiple divers onto your lane. Carmilla's shield plus Frozen buys two survival layers.; Glowing Wand over Genius Wand when Extended sustain fights where Carmilla is tanking and you need the HP burn from range.
- Total cost: 12100 gold

Gold lane build for the Carmilla pair. Carmilla's frontline presence covers Divine Glaive slot; Holy Crystal plus Genius Wand front-loads damage for Moonlit Waltz engages. Blood Wings shield resets between waves when Carmilla soaks pressure.

